<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32484" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏlĭdus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		oleo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>smelling</i>, <i>emitting a smell</i> (mostly
			post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vasa picata bene olida,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 17</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bene olidae amphorae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					12, 38, 4</span></i>
			.—Of a bad smell, <i>stinking</i>, <i>rank</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">olida capra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 5, 29</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praesaepia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					8, 157</span></i>
			: senex, Suet <i><span class="en">Tib. 45</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vulpes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. 10, 37, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aures,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					25, 5, 18, § 40</span></i>
			.—<i>Sup.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">basia olidissima,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 21</span></i>
			.</div>
